homelab-webproxy (0.1.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pull model: a site may use discover: <feature> to derive its upstream
    pool live from homelab-api (fleet view); homelab-webproxy-pull.timer
    re-runs apply-sites every ~2min and reloads nginx only when a pool
    changes. Lets the roundcube pool track the fleet with no manual edit.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:17:58 -0500

